el) and baseball season tickets holders.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg"><media:title> Gold Rush Returns Ticket Program</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:49:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59614</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Defeat Coastal Carolina for Fourth Consecutive Victory</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-coastal-carolina-for-fourth-consecutive-victory</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-coastal-carolina-for-fourth-consecutive-victory</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Julen Recalde celebrates after scoring a goal against Coastal Carolina" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.VA. (Oct. 29, 2026) – The No. 13 West Virginia University men's soccer team picked up its fourth straight victory with a 2-0 win over Coastal Carolina, Thursday evening at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium. The Mountaineers improve to 9-2-4 and 5-1-2 in the Sun Belt while the Chanticleers fall to 5-6-4 and 3-3-2 in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg"><media:title>Julen Recalde celebrates after scoring a goal against Coastal Carolina</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:45:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59613</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Roll Frostburg State in Thursday Night Exhibition</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/womens-basketball-mountaineers-roll-frostburg-state-in-thursday-night-exhibition</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/womens-basketball-mountaineers-roll-frostburg-state-in-thursday-night-exhibition</guid><category>Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Divine Tumba drive for a layup in the Mountaineers exhibition win over Frostburg State on Thursday, Oct. 29 inside Hope Coliseum" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/29/WBBALL_vFrostburg_102926-13.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – West Virginia rolled in its only preseason game of the season, downing Frostburg State 111-41 on Thursday night at Hope Coliseum.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/WBBALL_vFrostburg_102926-13.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/WBBALL_vFrostburg_102926-13.jpg"><media:title>Divine Tumba drive for a layup in the Mountaineers exhibition win over Frostburg State on Thursday, Oct. 29 inside Hope Coliseum</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;i